    "intro": {
      "en": "Hi Evan! Today is a story day with no new words. We read a short story about five people at home, and the words that have slipped come back as part of the story. Listen to each line and say it out loud.",
      "py": "Nǐ hǎo, Evan! Jīntiān shì gùshi rì, méiyǒu xīn cí. Wǒmen dú yí gè guānyú jiā lǐ wǔ gè rén de duǎn gùshi, wàngdiào de cí huì zài gùshi lǐ huílái. Měi yí jù dōu xiān tīng, ránhòu dàshēng shuō."
    },
    "blocks": [
