        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Story: Five People at Home"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "en": "Today is a story day with no new words. Read the short story about a family at dinner, then listen to every line. The words that have slipped, like soup, fish, vegetables, five, and white, show up inside the story. Notice how the same small words keep coming back.",
        "py": "Jīntiān shì gùshi rì, méiyǒu xīn cí. Xiān dú yí gè guānyú yì jiā rén chī fàn de duǎn gùshi, ránhòu tīng měi yí jù. Wàngdiào de cí, bǐrú tāng, yú, cài, wǔ hé báisè, dōu zài gùshi lǐmiàn. Zhùyì zhèxiē xiǎo cí zěnme yìzhí huílái."
      },
      {
