        "note_py": "Cài shì dì-sì shēng.",
        "listen_url": "l22-cai.mp3"
      },
      {
        "type": "vocab_card",
        "en": "animal",
        "py": "dòngwù",
        "note_en": "Dòngwù: 4th tone twice.",
        "note_py": "Dòngwù: liǎng gè dì-sì shēng.",
        "listen_url": "l22-dongwu.mp3"
      },
      {
        "type": "vocab_card",
        "en": "four",
        "py": "sì",
        "note_en": "Sì is 4th tone, sharp and falling. Not shí (ten).",
        "note_py": "Sì shì dì-sì shēng. Bú shì shí.",
        "listen_url": "l22-si.mp3"
      },
      {
        "type": "vocab_card",
        "en": "white",
        "py": "báisè",
        "note_en": "Báisè: 2nd tone, then 4th tone.",
        "note_py": "Báisè: dì-èr shēng, ránhòu dì-sì shēng.",
        "listen_url": "l22-baise.mp3"
      },
      {
        "type": "vocab_card",
        "en": "one",
        "py": "yī",
        "note_en": "Yī is 1st tone alone, but before a 4th tone it becomes yí (yí gè), and before zhī (1st tone) it is yì: yì zhī.",
        "note_py": "Yī dān shuō shì dì-yī shēng; zài dì-sì shēng qián biàn yí; zài zhī qián biàn yì: yì zhī.",
        "listen_url": "l22-yi.mp3"
      },
      {
        "type": "callout",
        "kind": "pattern",
        "title": "Pattern: who eats or drinks what",
        "body_en": "Say who, then chī (eat) or hē (drink), then what: Jiějie chī yú. Mèimei hē tāng. Use hé (and) to join people: bàba hé māma. To count animals use zhī: yì zhī māo.",
        "body_py": "Xiān shuō shéi, ránhòu shuō chī huò hē, zuìhòu shuō shénme: Jiějie chī yú. Mèimei hē tāng. Yòng hé lián rén: bàba hé māma. Shǔ dòngwù yòng zhī: yì zhī māo."
      }
    ]
  },
